          "text": "Finally, sequence the learning. Identify foundations, methods, advanced work, and a project that forces the fields to interact. RIT individualized study pairs this planning with academic advising and connections to faculty and experiential learning. The goal is not maximum variety. It is an intentional path that produces evidence you can address the question."
